msgstr "Aktivitet per typ"

msgid "Add the look-alike domains to your block lists and ask the registrar or vendor to act on typosquats."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till de förväxlingsbara domänerna i era blockeringslistor och be registraren eller leverantören att agera mot "
"typosquatting."

msgid "Age"
msgstr "Ålder"

#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"All incoming mail (Log Export): {claimed_own} message(s) claimed one of your domains in From:, "
"{claimed_own_convicted} of them convicted. The Return-Path domain differed from the From: domain in {mismatch_pct} % "
"of {incoming} incoming messages."
msgstr ""
"All inkommande e-post (Log Export): {claimed_own} meddelande(n) angav en av era domäner i From:, varav "
"{claimed_own_convicted} hotklassades. Return-Path-domänen skilde sig från From:-domänen i {mismatch_pct} % av "
"{incoming} inkommande meddelande(n)."

msgid "All tenants"
msgstr "Alla tenants"

