msgstr ""
"Blockera eller ta bort .html/.htm/.svg-bilagor i gatewayen - antal HTML/SVG-bilagor som bar hot: {html_svg} (HTML-"
"smuggling, SVG-nätfiske)."

msgid "Block script, shortcut and executable attachments outright; they have no business use in mail."
msgstr "Blockera skript, genvägar och körbara bilagor helt; de har ingen affärsnytta i e-post."

